data.read-responses#Read responses:
v2 success responses use a standard envelope:
{
  "request_id": "envi_8fb675af-3432-4c4e-8f0e-6a0434e50c64",
  "data": {},
  "error": null
}
List responses can also include metadata.pagination. Errors keep data null
and contain a stable machine-readable error.code:
{
  "request_id": "envi_8fb675af-3432-4c4e-8f0e-6a0434e50c64",
  "data": null,
  "error": {
    "code": "forbidden_scope",
    "message": "The API key does not grant the required scope."
  }
}
Log request_id with your integration's own operation ID. Branch on HTTP status
and error.code, not the human-readable message.

